@baseAddress = http://127.0.0.1:REPLACE_WITH_EPHEMERAL_PORT
@identity = REPLACE_WITH_PROCESS_PROVISIONED_CREDENTIAL
@scanId = REPLACE_WITH_EXACT_SCAN_ID
@sessionId = REPLACE_WITH_EXACT_SESSION_ID
@connectionId = REPLACE_WITH_EXCHANGED_CONNECTION_ID
@connectionToken = REPLACE_WITH_EXCHANGED_CONNECTION_TOKEN

### Trusted host must opt into the fixed pixel fixture and optional service.
### These placeholders are documentation; the finite --private-pixels proof closes its server.
GET {{baseAddress}}/viewer/{{scanId}}/{{sessionId}}/pixels?epoch=1
Authorization: Bearer {{identity}}
X-Viewer-Id: {{connectionId}}
X-Viewer-Token: {{connectionToken}}

### Expected 405. No input is accepted or forwarded.
POST {{baseAddress}}/viewer/{{scanId}}/{{sessionId}}/pixels?epoch=1
Authorization: Bearer {{identity}}
X-Viewer-Id: {{connectionId}}
X-Viewer-Token: {{connectionToken}}

### Expected 404. There is no clipboard read or write endpoint.
POST {{baseAddress}}/viewer/{{scanId}}/{{sessionId}}/clipboard
Authorization: Bearer {{identity}}
X-Viewer-Id: {{connectionId}}
X-Viewer-Token: {{connectionToken}}
